{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S01、S05等短停留段的感受短语堆得较密，容易来不及扫完；X的右栏相对收敛，阅读负担更稳定。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮短语把每段心理转折和关键关系突出出来，感受又有具体的身体触感、声部变化和乐句时点，既容易抓重点，也更容易听出细腻变化。X的完整叙述在解释人物动机和因果关系上略胜一筹，但Y反复建立的水面、小船、摇荡等意象，以及与音乐进程的对应，让整段经历更像一件连续发生的事。整体我选Y。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "689badc2-69fe-4642-b969-314722e47eb1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T014227178820Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:43:57.650080+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fef830814a4cac7f4c92c18801540d26cfe80198973e6fa32d678fae2c76729d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evi